#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-lib.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-lib.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If needed, enable the following options in the kernel configuration and "
"recompile the kernel:"
msgstr ""
"Se necessário, habilite as seguintes opções na configuração do núcleo e "
"recompile o núcleo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-lib.xml:126
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In the Device Drivers &rArr; Sound card support &rArr; Advanced Linux Sound "
"Architecture section of the kernel configuration, select the settings and "
"drivers appropriate for your hardware.  If necessary, recompile and install "
"your new kernel."
msgstr ""
"Na seção Device Drivers &rArr; Sound card support &rArr; Advanced Linux "
"Sound Architecture da configuração do núcleo, selecione as configurações e "
"controladores apropriados para o teu hardware. Se necessário, recompile e "
"instale teu novo núcleo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><indexterm><primary>
